      {"n": 1, "title": "Start with the reservoir", "text": "Set the watertight outer pot down and pour in a few centimetres of water."},
      {"n": 2, "title": "Thread the wick", "text": "Push the cotton wick through the inner pot's hole so it dangles into the water."},
      {"n": 3, "title": "Seat the inner pot", "text": "Lower the inner pot into the reservoir, keeping the wick hanging straight down."},
      {"n": 4, "title": "Fill and plant", "text": "Pack peat-free potting mix around the wick and settle your plant on top."},
